{"format":1,"manifest":{"name":"cobol","publisher":"vyloxi","version":"1.1.0","displayName":"COBOL","description":"Syntax coloring, comment toggling and snippets for COBOL (.cob .cbl .cpy).","engines":{"ferrum":"^0.1.0"},"categories":["Languages"],"icon":"icon.png","repository":"https://github.com/voukengdongmofrankysteve/ferrum-market","license":"MIT","contributes":{"languages":[{"id":"cobol","name":"COBOL","extensions":[".cob",".cbl",".cpy"],"grammar":"grammars/cobol.json","lineComment":"*>"}],"snippets":[{"language":"COBOL","path":"snippets/cobol.json"}]}},"files":{"icon.png":{"encoding":"base64","content":""},"grammars/cobol.json":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"{\n  \"ignoreCase\": true,\n  \"rules\": [\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\*>.*$\",\n      \"token\": \"comment\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\"(?:[^\\\"\\\\\\\\]|\\\\\\\\.)*\\\"\",\n      \"token\": \"string\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"'(?:[^'\\\\\\\\]|\\\\\\\\.)*'\",\n      \"token\": \"string\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:IDENTIFICATION|ENVIRONMENT|DATA|PROCEDURE) DIVISION\\\\b|\\\\b[A-Z0-9-]+ SECTION\\\\b|\\\\bPROGRAM-ID\\\\b|\\\\bWORKING-STORAGE\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"macro\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:0[xX][0-9a-fA-F_]+|0[bB][01_]+|0[oO][0-7_]+|\\\\d[\\\\d_]*(?:\\\\.\\\\d[\\\\d_]*)?(?:[eE][+-]?\\\\d+)?)[uUlLfFdDnNiI]{0,3}\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"number\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:END-PERFORM|INITIALIZE|CONTINUE|EVALUATE|MULTIPLY|SUBTRACT|UNSTRING|COMPUTE|DISPLAY|INSPECT|PERFORM|RELEASE|REWRITE|VARYING|ACCEPT|CANCEL|DELETE|DIVIDE|END-IF|GOBACK|RETURN|SEARCH|STRING|GIVING|ALTER|CLOSE|MERGE|START|WRITE|UNTIL|TIMES|USING|CALL|ELSE|EXIT|MOVE|OPEN|READ|SORT|STOP|WHEN|THEN|FROM|INTO|ADD|SET|GO|IF|TO|BY)\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"keyword\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:HIGH-VALUES|LOW-VALUES|SPACES|ZEROS|SPACE|FALSE|ZERO|TRUE)\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"constant\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:REDEFINES|PICTURE|COMP-3|OCCURS|VALUE|COMP|PIC)\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"type\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n"},"snippets/cobol.json":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"{\n  \"Program skeleton\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"prog\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.\",\n      \"PROGRAM-ID. ${1:HELLO}.\",\n      \"PROCEDURE DIVISION.\",\n      \"    DISPLAY \\\"${2:Hello}\\\".\",\n      \"    STOP RUN.\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A program\"\n  },\n  \"Perform until\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"perf\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"PERFORM UNTIL ${1:condition}\",\n      \"    $0\",\n      \"END-PERFORM.\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"PERFORM UNTIL\"\n  }\n}\n"},"README.md":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"# COBOL\n\nSyntax coloring, comment toggling and snippets for COBOL.\n\n## Files\n\n`.cob`, `.cbl`, `.cpy`\n\n## Features\n\n- Colors keywords, types, strings, numbers, comments and more. The colors follow your theme.\n- **Toggle Line Comment** (Ctrl+/) uses `*>`.\n- 2 snippets.\n\n## Snippets\n\nType the prefix and press Tab.\n\n| Prefix | What it inserts |\n| --- | --- |\n| `prog` | A program |\n| `perf` | PERFORM UNTIL |\n\nThis extension runs no code and asks for no permissions. It is built with the [language contribution](https://ferrum.vyloxi.com/docs/languages) format.\n"}}}